<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Household Shifting Checklist Hazaribagh | Pre-Move Guide
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for IBA‑approved packers and movers in Hazaribagh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To comply with IBA standards, you need a valid GST registration certificate, the mover’s IBA approval letter, a signed service agreement, a detailed inventory list, and a copy of the e‑Way bill for each shipment. Keeping these documents handy ensures smooth customs clearance and hassle‑free reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How can I estimate the cost to transport household goods from Delhi to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Begin by measuring the volume of your belongings in cubic feet and noting any special items like pianos or antiques. Request quotes from at least three IBA‑approved movers, compare base freight, packing material charges, insurance premiums, and any fuel surcharges. Adding a 5‑10% buffer for unforeseen expenses gives a realistic budget.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures does Shree Ashirwad use for fragile items during transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad employs a 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system that includes heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, corrugated fiberboard sheets, and weather‑proof stretch film. Fragile items are placed in custom wooden crates, secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, and tracked via GPS to prevent mishandling.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How far in advance should I book my moving truck for a long‑distance shift?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For intercity moves like Delhi to Mumbai, it’s advisable to book the truck at least 4‑6 weeks ahead. Early booking secures the preferred vehicle size—whether an 18 ft, 22 ft, or 32 ft MX container—and guarantees availability of specialized carriers for two‑wheelers and multi‑car trailers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the household shifting rates in Hazaribagh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transparent movers disclose all fees upfront. Hidden charges may arise from unlisted stair‑case handling, extra‑long carry‑outs, or last‑minute changes in inventory. Always request a detailed cost sheet that itemizes freight, packing, insurance, GST, and any optional services to avoid surprise expenses.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does live GPS tracking improve the security of my shipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Live GPS tracking provides real‑time visibility of your cargo, allowing you to monitor route adherence, estimated arrival times, and any deviations. This transparency deters theft, enables proactive communication with the driver, and gives you peace of mind that your belongings are moving safely along the NH 19 corridor.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance options are available for my belongings during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad offers IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering 100% declared value of your items. You can choose basic coverage for standard goods or comprehensive plans that include accidental damage, loss, and natural calamities. Review the policy terms to ensure adequate protection for high‑value or antique pieces.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
